</span>
<span style="height:1px;background:#dcdfe3;margin:4px 0"></span>
<span style="font-weight:700;font-size:12px">Fuel cell cycle</span>
<span id="phaseBtns" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px">
